# Replace port with api-gateway's HTTP endpoint shown in Aspire.
@gateway = http://localhost:17320
@adminIdentity = {{gateway}}/admin-identity
@adminAccessToken = paste-admin-rs256-access-token-here
@adminRefreshToken = paste-admin-refresh-token-here
@bffClientSecret = paste-admin-oidc-bff-client-secret-here

### Admin OIDC Discovery & Public RSA JWKS
GET {{adminIdentity}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{adminIdentity}}/.well-known/jwks

### Exchange Authorization Code + PKCE (confidential BFF client davids-admin-bff)
POST {{adminIdentity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&client_id=davids-admin-bff&client_secret={{bffClientSecret}}&code=paste-auth-code&redirect_uri={{gateway}}%2Fsignin-oidc&code_verifier=paste-pkce-verifier

### Rotate single-use administrator refresh token
POST {{adminIdentity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=davids-admin-bff&client_secret={{bffClientSecret}}&refresh_token={{adminRefreshToken}}

### Current administrator profile (/me and OIDC /connect/userinfo)
GET {{adminIdentity}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

###
GET {{adminIdentity}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### List administrator accounts (stored in adminidentitydb)
GET {{adminIdentity}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Provision a new administrator account (admin-only; no public sign-up exists)
POST {{adminIdentity}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ops.admin@davids.local",
  "password": "Strong-Admin-Password-123!",
  "fullName": "Operations Administrator"
}

### RFC 7009 Administrator Token Revocation
POST {{adminIdentity}}/connect/revocation
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=davids-admin-bff&client_secret={{bffClientSecret}}&token={{adminAccessToken}}&token_type_hint=access_token
